        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>The diagrams show a small museum and its surroundings in 1990 and 2010. </strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Small Museum and Surroundings: 1990 vs 2010</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Small Museum and Surroundings: 1990 vs 2010 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục một bảo t&agrave;ng nhỏ v&agrave; khu vực xung quanh của n&oacute; v&agrave;o năm 1990 v&agrave; 2010.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Small Museum and Surroundings: 1990 vs 2010 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục của một bảo t&agrave;ng nhỏ v&agrave; c&aacute;c khu vực xung quanh - từ năm 1990 đến 2010.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URUgdOFlfoTLuOx4fhol6qV1gQ3\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2X3dVPT9ovlPbxnKGVlh3ndguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">bảo t&agrave;ng đ&atilde; trải qua <strong>sự mở rộng v&agrave; cải tạo đ&aacute;ng kể</strong><em> (significant expansion and renovation)</em> trong giai đoạn 20 năm n&agrave;y.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2X3dVPT9ovlPbxnKGVlh3ndguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">những thay đổi nổi bật nhất bao gồm việc thay thế cottage bằng cafe, việc mở rộng đ&aacute;ng kể car park, v&agrave; việc bổ sung exhibition space mới trong main building.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BgHSd2dTeomakhx6OoxlhVwogvg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong>&nbsp; Khu vực bảo t&agrave;ng ch&iacute;nh (khu vực b&ecirc;n trong)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAFrds4TtoPHPjxh4OnlHmgUg8c\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gx0udTLlgo6V0UxOEXqlss4tg8f\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ở ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i lối v&agrave;o, hai ph&ograve;ng triển l&atilde;m vốn được ngăn c&aacute;ch bởi c&aacute;c bức tường <strong>đ&atilde; được hợp nhất th&agrave;nh một ph&ograve;ng duy nhất </strong><em>(be merged into one)</em>&nbsp;v&agrave;o năm 2010</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gx0udTLlgo6V0UxOEXqlss4tg8f\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>shop&nbsp;</strong>đ&atilde; <strong>mở rộng đ&aacute;ng kể</strong> <em>(significantly expanded)</em> bằng c&aacute;ch c<strong>hiếm dụng kh&ocirc;ng gian của exhibition room cũ</strong> <em>(occupying the former exhibition room space)</em>, tạo ra much larger retail area.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYUzdHE5kojHwlxhmijlDNIogVc\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>entrance </strong>v&agrave; <strong>store room ở g&oacute;c tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i </strong>vẫn <strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ban đầu</strong><em> (remained in their original positions)</em>, <strong>duy tr&igrave; bố cục chức năng cơ bản của to&agrave; nh&agrave;</strong><em>&nbsp;(maintaining the basic functional layout của building.)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2</strong><strong>: Khu vực c&ograve;n lại (khu vực b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i)</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HUqOdarQwow7hQxpsnulpYNmgGe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y7iEdiO8toRyq0xWEqal0a9cgoI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>cottage</strong>, nằm ở ph&iacute;a bắc của <strong>khu phức hợp</strong><em> (complex)</em> v&agrave;o năm 1990,<strong> đ&atilde; được thay thế ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n bởi một qu&aacute;n cafe</strong><em> (was completely replaced by a cafe)</em> v&agrave;o năm 2010.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y7iEdiO8toRyq0xWEqal0a9cgoI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">b&atilde;i đậu xe đ&atilde; mở rộng đ&aacute;ng kể <strong>nhờ việc bỏ lu&ocirc;n một khu vườn lớn gần đ&oacute;</strong> <em>(at the expense of a large garden nearby)</em>, ph&aacute;t triển từ một khu vực nhỏ ở ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng của bản đồ năm 1990 th&agrave;nh một cơ sở lớn hơn nhiều v&agrave; mở rộng đ&aacute;ng kể về ph&iacute;a nam v&agrave;o năm 2010</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y7iEdiO8toRyq0xWEqal0a9cgoI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Khu vườn c&ograve;n lại ở ph&iacute;a bắc <strong>vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n&nbsp;</strong><em>(remain unchanged)</em>&nbsp;trong suốt thời gian n&agrave;y, vẫn c&oacute; nhiều c&acirc;y xanh.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1776,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The diagrams illustrate the layout of a small museum and its surrounding area in 1990 and the changes that occurred by 2010.</p>",
            "question_id": 18387,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1777,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the museum underwent significant expansion and renovation during this 20-year period. The most notable changes included the replacement of the cottage with a cafe, substantial enlargement of the car park, and the addition of new exhibition space within the main building.</p>",
            "question_id": 18387,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1778,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the main museum building, the internal layout experienced significant modifications between 1990 and 2010. On the left-hand side of the entrance, the two exhibition rooms, which used to be separated by walls, were merged into one by 2010. The shop subsequently expanded considerably by occupying the former exhibition room space, creating a much larger retail area. Meanwhile, the store room in the upper left section and the entrance remained in their original positions and sizes.</p>",
            "question_id": 18387,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1779,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>As for the surrounding facilities, the most striking transformation occurred on the southern side of the complex, where the cottage that existed in 1990 was completely replaced by a cafe by 2010. Additionally, the car park experienced dramatic expansion at the expense of a large garden nearby, growing from a small area on the eastern side of the map in 1990 to a much larger facility that extended significantly further south by 2010. The other garden area in the north remained unchanged over the period, still housing a number of green trees.</p>",
